title: The Saxon Question
subtitle: The congress debates the workers' government.
view-if: congress_leipzig = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and e23_lz_saxony_used = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.e23_lz_saxony_used = 1;
Q.e23_lz_sax_ours = (Q.saxony_government == 1 || Q.e22_saxon_toleration == 1) ? 1 : 0;
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Saxon Question

The longest debate of the congress is about one Land. [? if e23_lz_sax_ours = 1 : In Dresden a Social Democratic government holds office with our votes. ?][? if e23_lz_sax_ours = 0 : In Dresden the Social Democrats govern without us. ?] Thalheimer says a workers' government in Saxony would be the first step to power. Fischer says it would be the first step into a coalition.

- @road: The road to power runs through Dresden.
- @street: The road to power runs through the Ruhr.
- @refer: Refer it to the new Zentrale.

@road
subtitle: Wins Saxon and Thuringian delegates who are not yet ours.
on-arrival: {!
var n = RG.congress.convert('saxony', 0.3) + RG.congress.convert('thuringia', 0.3);
if (Q.unionist_gone == 0) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.03); }
RG.congress.tally();
Q.e23_lz_moved = n;
!}

The Saxons cheer every sentence about the control committees. [? if e23_lz_moved > 0 : [+ e23_lz_moved +] of them, and of the Thuringians, come over to us. ?]

@street
subtitle: Wins Berlin and Hamburg delegates who are not yet ours.
on-arrival: {!
var n = RG.congress.convert('berlin', 0.25) + RG.congress.convert('hamburg', 0.25);
if (Q.offensive_gone == 0) { RG.congress.swayTo('offensive', 0.03); }
RG.congress.tally();
Q.e23_lz_moved = n;
!}

A government in Dresden, our speakers say, is worth less than a strike in Essen. [? if e23_lz_moved > 0 : [+ e23_lz_moved +] Berlin and Hamburg delegates come over to us. ?]

@refer
subtitle: Calms the hall. Few votes either way.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.03);
RG.congress.bitter(-3);
Q.unity += 2;
!}

The congress refers the Saxon question to the new Zentrale with a resolution both sides can vote for. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] tired delegates are grateful enough to vote with us. ?]
